  "title": "This Is How Many Agents China's Free AI Can Run Right Now",
  "description": "China's Moonshot AI just launched Kimi Work, a free desktop app powered by Kimi K2.6 that runs an agent swarm of up to 300 sub-agents in parallel on your own computer. In one demo it found 30 local businesses with no website and built a site for each in about 30 minutes.\n\nHere is what it really is, how to try it free, and the honest data-privacy catch: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1x8r3xLVcL1Dcxa5qnms9qNqVtnPahZUefX5NZvJ39tI/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #KimiAI #AIagents",
